Dependencies
------------

The Go standard library only.

Test data
---------

Apart from the Traccar test vectors above and the sample frames of the
manufacturers' documents (protocol facts, see PROVENANCE.md), every IMEI,
ICCID, phone number, password, position and device ID in the tests and
the examples is a made-up demo value. The AIS-140 tests use packets of
our own in the standard's field layouts, not the standard's samples.

